# Architecture & intent

- Read `architecture/SYSTEM_OVERVIEW.md` and relevant `adr/ADR-*.md` before cross-cutting refactors.
- Non-trivial features need a spec under `specs/` (copy from `specs/templates/`).
- Public HTTP surface must stay consistent with `openapi/openapi.yaml` — update spec with code.
- Link new decisions to Linear issues (Terravolt Omni project) when tracking delivery.
